msgstr ""

msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Kawashima"
msgstr "Sobre Kawashima"

msgid "When word gets out, everyone will flip"
msgstr "Cuando se sepa, todos enloquecerán"

msgid "What role did you get in the movie?"
msgstr "¿Qué papel conseguiste en la película?"

msgid "Will you act under a stage name?"
msgstr "¿Actuarás bajo un nombre artístico?"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "That DVD Taiga gave you......"
msgstr "Ese DVD que te dio Taiga......"

msgid "Should I tell her I gave up on Kushieda?"
msgstr "¿Le digo que me rendí con Kushieda?"

msgid "I wonder if she went back to school"
msgstr "Me pregunto si volvió a la escuela"

msgid "About the Test of Courage"
msgstr "Sobre la Prueba de Valor"

msgid "I'm glad I was with you that night"
msgstr "Me alegra haber estado contigo esa noche"

msgid "There was no ghost"
msgstr "No había ningún fantasma"

msgid "I'm really sorry about that night"
msgstr "De verdad siento lo de esa noche"

msgid "About Classmates"
msgstr "Sobre los compañeros"

msgid "Some guys started crying over you"
msgstr "Algunos chicos empezaron a llorar por ti"

msgid "Everyone was blown away"
msgstr "Todos quedaron impactados"

msgid "You talked about this with Kitamura"
msgstr "Hablaste de esto con Kitamura"

msgid "About School"
msgstr "Sobre la escuela"

msgid "Is there anywhere else you want to go?"
msgstr "¿Hay algún otro lugar al que quieras ir?"

msgid "Did you forget any of your stuff?"
msgstr "¿Olvidaste alguna de tus cosas?"

msgid "Will you promise not to forget us?"
msgstr "¿Prometes no olvidarte de nosotros?"

msgid "--Let's Talk Things Over with Ami!--"
msgstr "--¡Hablemos las cosas con Ami!--"

msgid "Ami「I'm not sure I appreciate...... you looking＿at me like that.」"
msgstr "Ami「No estoy segura de que me guste......＿que me mires así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Uh, err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Ah, ehm......」"

msgid "Ami「So...... Ugh, forget it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Entonces...... Agh, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Ami「That's all you got!? What a joke.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿Eso es todo?! Qué chiste.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Why are you getting so mad?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿P-Por qué te enojas tanto?」"

msgid "Ami「Hmph! I'm not!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Jum! ¡No estoy enojada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's your problem......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa......?」"

msgid "Ami「I'll be pissed if you're doing that to try＿and manipulate me, but if you're＿serious...... I'll still be pissed.」"
msgstr "Ami「Me voy a enojar si haces eso para＿intentar manipularme, pero si hablas＿en serio...... igual me voy a enojar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you're just pissed either way?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿O sea que te enojas de todas formas?」"

msgid "Ami「I'll be frank: stop trying to look cool.」"
msgstr "Ami「Seré franca: no intentes verte genial.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh...... Frank, indeed......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah...... Qué franca, sí......」"

msgid "Ami「Are you serious right now? You're the＿most despicable creep ever.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Hablas en serio? Eres el tipo＿más despreciable del mundo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's a little harsh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es un poco cruel......」"

msgid "Ami「What do you expect will happen by＿making that face?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué esperas que pase poniendo esa cara?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not expecting anything in＿particular.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No espero nada en particular.」"

msgid "Ami「That look does NOT suit you.」"
msgstr "Ami「Esa mirada NO te queda bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This is my normal face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esta es mi cara normal.」"

msgid "Ami「Liar. You should relax a bit...... Oh,＿forget it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mentiroso. Deberías relajarte＿un poco...... Ah, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun...... You smell like coffee.」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun...... Hueles a café.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't say that to someone who's trying＿to be serious!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No le digas eso a alguien que＿intenta ponerse serio!」"

msgid "Ami「Then don't try to be serious.」"
msgstr "Ami「Entonces no intentes ponerte serio.」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun, you know, instead of＿trying to act cool, you should just be＿yourself.」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun, sabes, en vez de intentar＿verte genial, deberías ser tú mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ami「Really. I'm a model, so I would know.」"
msgstr "Ami「De verdad. Soy modelo, así que lo sé.」"

msgid "Ami「What? Want to kiss me or something?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué? ¿Quieres besarme o algo así?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「D-Don't be stupid!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No digas tonterías!!」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Juju!」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun...... No, it's nothing.」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun...... No, no es nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ami「Never mind!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡No importa!」"

msgid "Ami「I knew it! It was bound to happen,＿since their blossoming rose is about to＿vanish.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Lo sabía! Era inevitable,＿ya que su rosa en flor está＿a punto de desaparecer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That \"rose\" has poisonous thorns.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......La \"rosa\" tiene espinas venenosas.」"

msgid "Ami「Think people will boycott class and the＿school will shut down?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Crees que boicotearán las clases＿y cerrarán la escuela?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I can't say it's a definite no...... I guess?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No diría que no...... Supongo.」"

msgid "Ami「You gonna lock yourself in your room＿for 2-3 days?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Te vas a encerrar en tu＿cuarto por 2 o 3 días?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I only just got out of the hospital.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Apenas acabo de salir del hospital.」"

msgid "Ami「It won't last long. Everyone will forget＿soon enough.」"
msgstr "Ami「No durará mucho. Todos lo＿olvidarán muy pronto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, right!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí, claro!」"

msgid "Ami「You'll see. Fufu!」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya verás. ¡Juju!」"

msgid "Ami「Yes, literally everyone.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí, literalmente todos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You said that with such a straight face,＿too......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y lo dijiste con una cara＿tan seria, además......」"

msgid "Ami「As if I'd tell you.」"
msgstr "Ami「Como si te lo fuera a decir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why not?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué no?」"

msgid "Ami「I mean, do you actually care about this＿topic?」"
msgstr "Ami「Digo, ¿de verdad te importa este tema?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... N-No......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... N-No......」"

msgid "Ami「Look, I signed an agreement not to talk＿about it with just anyone! Can you＿think before you speak?」"
msgstr "Ami「Mira, ¡firmé un acuerdo para no＿hablar de eso con cualquiera! ¿Puedes＿pensar antes de hablar?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry, I had no idea that was a thing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Perdón, no sabía que existía eso.」"

msgid "Ami「Sheesh, quit trying to piss me off.」"
msgstr "Ami「Cielos, deja de intentar hacerme enojar.」"

msgid "Ami「A high schooler who plays the villain.」"
msgstr "Ami「Una villana de preparatoria.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wow...... Wait, YOU?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya...... Espera, ¿TÚ?」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Juju!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What are you talking about? Jeez.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿De qué estás hablando? Cielos.」"

msgid "Ami「Why? Is that bad?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Por qué? ¿Tiene algo de malo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's just, I figured everyone in the＿entertainment industry uses one.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es solo que imaginé que todos en la＿industria del entretenimiento usan uno.」"

msgid "Ami「......Well, not like it matters.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Bueno, tampoco es que importe.」"

msgid "Ami「Excuse me!? There's nothing wrong＿with Ami-chan keeping her real name.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿Disculpa?! No tiene nada de malo que＿Ami-chan conserve su nombre real.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-That wasn't what I meant...... Sorry, I'll＿mind my own business.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No me refería a eso...... Perdón,＿me ocuparé de mis propios asuntos.」"

msgid "Ami「Well, I gotta ride my mom's coattails～」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, debo aprovechar la fama de mamá～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh right, Kawashima Anna-san from＿the Yuuzuki Reiko series.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, claro, Kawashima Anna-san,＿de la serie Yuuzuki Reiko.」"

msgid "Ami「Exaaactly. Hmph.」"
msgstr "Ami「Exaaacto. Jum.」"

msgid "Ami「Maybe.」"
msgstr "Ami「Tal vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ehm......」"

msgid "Ami「Makes more sense to maintain the＿spotless Kawashima reputation.」"
msgstr "Ami「Tiene más sentido mantener la impecable＿reputación de los Kawashima.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ami「Well, I'd like to improve it a little, you＿know? Make it more of a household＿name.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, me gustaría mejorarla＿un poco, ¿sabes? Hacer que sea＿un nombre más conocido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Frankly I don't know much about it,＿but I'm sure you'll improve it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......La verdad, no sé mucho de eso,＿pero seguro que la mejorarás.」"

msgid "Ami「That's the plan.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ese es el plan.」"

msgid "Ami「What about it? Have you watched it?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué pasa con eso? ¿Lo viste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I haven't......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no lo he visto......」"

msgid "Ami「Then drop it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Entonces deja el tema.」"

msgid "Ami「How do you know about that!? I can't＿believe this! Don't make fun of me!!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿Cómo sabes de eso?! ¡No puedo＿creerlo! ¡No te burles de mí!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, sorry......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, perdón......」"

msgid "Ami「Hmm～? Whatever are you talking＿about?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Mmm～? ¿De qué estarás hablando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'll take the hint.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Capté la indirecta.」"

msgid "Ami「*Sigh*...... Are you really asking me＿about that?」"
msgstr "Ami「*Suspiro*...... ¿De verdad me＿estás preguntando eso a mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Was that a bad idea?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ¿Fue mala idea?」"

msgid "Ami「You're despicable.」"
msgstr "Ami「Eres despreciable.」"

msgid "Ami「Why would you ask me about that!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿Por qué me preguntarías eso a mí?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Perdón!」"

msgid "Ami「Think for yourself.」"
msgstr "Ami「Piensa por ti mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ami「Who knows.」"
msgstr "Ami「Quién sabe.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I hope she hasn't fallen down＿somewhere...... Uh, I don't know why I＿brought this up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espero que no se haya caído＿por ahí...... Eh, no sé＿por qué saqué este tema.」"

msgid "Ami「Seriously.」"
msgstr "Ami「En serio.」"

msgid "Ami「Who cares?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿A quién le importa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Yeah, this was a pointless topic.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sí, fue un tema sin sentido.」"

msgid "Ami「Christ......」"
msgstr "Ami「Por Dios......」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, is Daddy worried about his little＿girl?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, ¿papi está preocupado por su niñita?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not her \"daddy.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No soy su \"papi\".」"

msgid "Ami「If you're so worried, why don't you go＿after her?」"
msgstr "Ami「Si tanto te preocupa, ¿por＿qué no vas tras ella?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll pass.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Paso.」"

msgid "Ami「Your concern does not surprise me.」"
msgstr "Ami「Tu preocupación no me sorprende.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She has these unforeseen clumsy＿moments sometimes......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A veces tiene esos momentos de＿torpeza inesperados......」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmmm.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, I bet～ Getting to walk the streets＿at night with a girl as cute as me is a＿once-in-a-lifetime experience～」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, seguro～ Pasear de noche por las＿calles con una chica tan linda como yo＿es una experiencia única en la vida～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not what I meant, but...... thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me refería a eso, pero...... gracias.」"

msgid "Ami「......Whaaat～? I don't know what you're＿talking about～」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Quéee～? No sé de＿qué estás hablando～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Never mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No importa.」"

msgid "Ami「You mean it～? Sounds fishy.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Lo dices en serio～? Suena sospechoso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I mean it. It was thanks to you that we＿made it back. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo digo en serio. Fue gracias a ti＿que logramos volver. Gracias.」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm......」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmmm......」"

msgid "Ami「Liar.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mentiroso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not lying. We made great progress＿thanks to you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No miento. Avanzamos muchísimo＿gracias a ti.」"

msgid "Ami「......That so?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. We made great progress thanks＿to you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Avanzamos muchísimo gracias a ti.」"

msgid "Ami「That's not all you want to ask, right?」"
msgstr "Ami「Quieres preguntar algo más, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「What a dolt you are...... You're so＿obvious.」"
msgstr "Ami「Qué tonto eres...... Eres tan obvio.」"

msgid "Ami「This isn't about the ghost.」"
msgstr "Ami「Esto no se trata del fantasma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Just ask. You want to ask me about＿what I said, right?」"
msgstr "Ami「Solo pregunta. Quieres preguntarme＿sobre lo que dije, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that's not it. I wasn't intending to......＿Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no es eso. No era mi＿intención...... Perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「Third Wheel Tiger made an＿appearance, though.」"
msgstr "Ami「Aunque la Tigre Entrometida＿hizo su aparición.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Y-Yeah...... That she did.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......S-Sí...... Así fue.」"

msgid "Ami「Forget it. Don't make me repeat＿myself.」"
msgstr "Ami「Olvídalo. No me hagas repetirlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Alright.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Está bien.」"

msgid "Ami「I HATE idiots who repeat themselves＿over and over.」"
msgstr "Ami「ODIO a los idiotas que se＿repiten una y otra vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, s-sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, p-perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「If I refuse to accept your apology, how＿will you make it up to me?」"
msgstr "Ami「Si me niego a aceptar tus disculpas,＿¿cómo me lo compensarás?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno......」"

msgid "Ami「Okay, we're done talking about this.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bien, ya terminamos de hablar de esto.」"

msgid "Ami「*Sigh*...... I'm tired of you repeating＿yourself.」"
msgstr "Ami「*Suspiro*...... Estoy harta＿de que te repitas tanto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But I feel really bad about it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pero me siento muy mal por eso!」"

msgid "Ami「And I'm tired of your feels.」"
msgstr "Ami「Y yo estoy harta de que te sientas así.」"

msgid "Ami「Let's not talk about this.」"
msgstr "Ami「No hablemos de esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Alright.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Está bien.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh wooow, like, I hope I didn't break＿their little hearts①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, vayaaa, o sea, espero no haberles＿roto sus corazoncitos①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I highly doubt that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo dudo muchísimo.」"

msgid "Ami「Does that mean you'll be beaten half to＿death for getting to see Ami-chan?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eso significa que te dejarán medio＿muerto a golpes por ver a Ami-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ugh...... I'll shut up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Agh...... Mejor me callo.」"

msgid "Ami「Crying, huh...... Fufu! Yeah, right.」"
msgstr "Ami「Llorando, ¿eh?...... ¡Juju! Sí, claro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You don't believe me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No me crees?」"

msgid "Ami「No, I don't.」"
msgstr "Ami「No, no te creo.」"

msgid "Ami「What about you? Did you cry?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y tú? ¿Lloraste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I didn't have time, chasing after you＿and all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No tuve tiempo, persiguiéndote＿y todo eso.」"

msgid "Ami「......I guess not.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Supongo que no.」"

msgid "Ami「Yeah...... I don't need you to tell me that.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí...... No hace falta que me lo digas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que no.」"

msgid "Ami「I don't give a damn about them～」"
msgstr "Ami「Me importan un comino～」"

msgid "Ami「So what? You think I can do anything＿about that?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y qué? ¿Crees que puedo＿hacer algo al respecto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You feel bad about it, don't you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Te sientes mal por eso, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ami「I couldn't care less.」"
msgstr "Ami「No me podría importar menos.」"

msgid "Ami「So?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Anything you want me to tell them?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Quieres que les diga algo?」"

msgid "Ami「It's a little late for that.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya es un poco tarde para eso.」"

msgid "Ami「I see.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eso es todo?」"

msgid "Ami「Meh...... It doesn't really matter.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bah...... En realidad no importa.」"

msgid "Ami「What about you? Just \"blown away,\"＿were you?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y tú? ¿Solo quedaste＿\"impactado\", verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I, uh...... I started running. I just had＿to see you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, yo, eh...... Empecé a＿correr. Tenía que verte.」"

msgid "Ami「Wow, you ran after me?」"
msgstr "Ami「Vaya, ¿corriste tras de mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Of course I did.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Por supuesto que sí.」"

msgid "Ami「Are you saying I should have told you＿too?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Estás diciendo que también debí＿habértelo contado a ti?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not what I meant. I'm just＿impressed by the friendship you two＿share.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me refería a eso. Solo me impresiona＿la amistad que tienen ustedes dos.」"

msgid "Ami「I told whoever I felt like telling. Don't＿pout over it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Se lo conté a quien me dio la gana.＿No hagas pucheros por eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not pouting.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estoy haciendo pucheros.」"

msgid "Ami「He helped me when I first moved here,＿so it made sense to tell him.」"
msgstr "Ami「Él me ayudó apenas me mudé aquí, así＿que tenía sentido decírselo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You have a point.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ami「So?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Ami「Not really.」"
msgstr "Ami「En realidad no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ami「Ami-chan isn't some mushy＿sentimental type!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ami-chan no es una chica＿sentimental y cursi!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「Weren't you listening? I just wanted to＿have one last vending machine drink.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿No estabas escuchando? Solo quería＿tomar una última bebida de la máquina.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you said......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso dijiste......」"

msgid "Ami「It's a little late now.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya es un poco tarde.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Yeah, I guess so.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sí, supongo que sí.」"

msgid "Ami「Do I look that sad to you?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Me ves tan triste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that's not what I meant......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no me refería a eso......」"

msgid "Ami「Then what did you mean?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Entonces a qué te referías?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Not sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No estoy seguro.」"

msgid "Ami「Who are you, my mother?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quién eres, mi madre?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I asked because I care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pregunté porque me preocupo.」"

msgid "Ami「Yeah, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí, sí.」"

msgid "Ami「Don't treat me like that stupid midget＿Tiger!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡No me trates como a esa＿estúpida enana Tigre!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, s-sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, p-perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「If I did, just throw it away.」"
msgstr "Ami「Si olvidé algo, solo tíralo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「MOTTAINAI!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Ami「I thought you'd say that. But I don't＿want to leave behind any mementos.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sabía que dirías eso. Pero no quiero＿dejar ningún recuerdo atrás.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「D-Don't say that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No digas eso......」"

msgid "Ami「No.」"
msgstr "Ami「No.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ami「I made sure not to.」"
msgstr "Ami「Me aseguré de no olvidar nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Good on you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bien por ti.」"

msgid "Ami「Why do you ask?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Por qué lo preguntas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I just wanted to.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo quería preguntarlo.」"

msgid "Ami「I see.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ami「I can't believe you had the nerve to ask＿me that. You're so irritating!」"
msgstr "Ami「No puedo creer que te atrevieras a＿preguntarme eso. ¡Qué irritante eres!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「No comment.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sin comentarios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo......」"

